# not from a tape — written for the app, so there is no v1 line to match.
@segment  resume
@title    Settling Back After a Pause
@levels   F10
@verbosity 2
@duration ~55s
@fixed

# Played when a session resumes after being paused, never on its own.
#
# The pause rewinds fifteen seconds before this, so the listener hears the tail
# of whatever they were in the middle of again -- but they have been *away*,
# and the tape's own lesson is that a voice arriving cold is a party pooper.
# This is the gradual re-entry: the bed comes up first, then this, then the
# session picks up where it left off.
#
# @fixed on purpose. It is the same words every time by design -- a familiar
# re-entry is a shorter one, and a variant here would make the return feel like
# a new instruction rather than a resumption.

say Take a moment. Let your attention come back to your body.
pause 6
say Let your shoulders fall away from your ears. Let your jaw soften. Let your hands rest exactly where they are.
pause 8
say Take one slow breath, and let it go without steering it.
pause 7
say Let your body become weightless again. Nothing to hold up, nothing to hold on to.
pause 8
say And when you are ready, we continue from where we were.
pause 5
